Z||000000||KRMFiero||08-10-2001||05:15 PM||||Well Our school system is i think dumb but oh well, we are suppost to starting now read 4-6 books during the summer then write:<BR>Journal - qoats from the book<BR>Personal Essay - How the book influanced me<BR>In-Class project - we will have a project to do when school starts.<P>They gace us a selected list of classics and stuff they they want us to read, i tyred most of them and they are so boring i cant consentrate on them. What books about the Fiero could I read? I would have to be able to write the quates and stuff. Also does anyone have book any reccomendations for a 15 year old who hates reading books. I need to pass, I think reading during the summer is stupid but if I dont I automaticly Fail 1st quater.<P>Kyle||||reg||1
